<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="Try Whop payments in a real Rails app. Hosted checkout, signed webhooks and subscription controls, powered by the community pay-whop gem.">
    <title>pay-whop · Rails payment playground</title>
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/whoptools/fonts.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/whoptools/theme.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/whoptools/playground.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to playground</a>
    <div class="shell">
      <header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/">pay-whop<span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>Rails</a><div class="actions"><span class="pill">Sandbox · no real money</span><a class="btn" href="https://whop.com/start/?code=CAKARK" rel="sponsored nofollow">Create a Whop account</a></div></header>
      <%= yield %>
      <footer>
        <p>Built by <a href="https://github.com/yshmarov">Yaroslav Shmarov</a>. An early community adapter for <a href="https://github.com/pay-rails/pay">Pay</a>, using Whop's official Ruby SDK.</p>
        <p>This browser's encrypted session cookie lasts 30 days. The app stores a random demo identity and billing IDs, amounts and states; card details stay on Whop's hosted checkout. Keep using this browser session with the same Whop sandbox account. No analytics or advertising cookies.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
